translate pt strings:

    old "Ask Kate to come to your room tonight"
    new "Peça a Kate que venha ao seu quarto hoje à noite"

    old "Don't say anything to Kate"
    new "Não diga nada à Kate"

    old "A great city was being put to the sword, and she had played a part in it."
    new "Uma grande cidade estava sendo destruída e ela havia participado disso."

    old "A place to which she would return."
    new "Um lugar ao qual ela retornaria."

